# The bundled daemon binary, produced by `npm run build:daemon` on every
# compile. 19 MB of build output that was tracked: every rebuild showed up as a
# spurious diff, and every commit of it is permanent repo weight. Packaging
# reads it from this path at vsce time; it does not need to be in history.
daemon/
